A list marker between an item's columns is a sibling only on every axis

```
- a
 - [ ] b
.
<ul>
  <li>a</li>
</ul>
<ul class="task-list">
  <li><input type="checkbox" disabled aria-label="b"> b</li>
</ul>
```

```
- [ ] a
 - b
.
<ul class="task-list">
  <li><input type="checkbox" disabled aria-label="a"> a</li>
</ul>
<ul>
  <li>b</li>
</ul>
```

```
1. a
 a.  b
.
<ol>
  <li>a</li>
</ol>
<ol type="a">
  <li>b</li>
</ol>
```

```
1. a
 i.  b
.
<ol>
  <li>a</li>
</ol>
<ol type="i">
  <li>b</li>
</ol>
```

```
a.  a
 1. b
.
<ol type="a">
  <li>a</li>
</ol>
<ol>
  <li>b</li>
</ol>
```

```
- x
  - a
   - [ ] b
.
<ul>
  <li>x
    <ul>
      <li>a</li>
    </ul>
    <ul class="task-list">
      <li><input type="checkbox" disabled aria-label="b"> b</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- [ ] a
 - [x] b
.
<ul class="task-list">
  <li><input type="checkbox" disabled aria-label="a"> a</li>
  <li data-task-state="x"><input type="checkbox" checked disabled aria-label="b"> b</li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
- [ ] b
.
<ul>
  <li>a</li>
</ul>
<ul class="task-list">
  <li><input type="checkbox" disabled aria-label="b"> b</li>
</ul>
```
